{"reviewId": "917211543_84BglYnAf", "review": {"abstract": "大都市化对我们今天所说的提升内需具有至关重要的作", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "05 走向成熟 中国经济即将V形反转", "chapterUid": 10, "content": "作者在08年预测我们后续发展大城市化的必要和必然，但25年的今天，08到现在发展17年中国的超级大城市化已经过度了，一线城市人口再增加会增加城市运转负荷压力，未来城市同心圆概念，慢慢产业转移人口反而是大城市往小城市聚集了", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "27972-27996", "createTime": 1762923895, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 10, "reviewId": "917211543_84BglYnAf", "userVid": 917211543, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "05 走向成熟 中国经济即将V形反转", "author": {"userVid": 917211543, "name": "余月", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/AzTvG5sSia2LNDejNxJrbBJcgc8UegII86UXyFicNa1MIqnJ57cblKGfNXBxs3iarPzdFNa8DNfqFM9j0KlEMr7DJnAOt1xRYtBhS1FpC04iaxM/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-100", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 1, "likes": [{"userVid": 104815730, "name": "Excellent", "avatar": "https://weread-picture-1258476243.file.myqcloud.com/avatar/11931.png", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "Excellent", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": ""}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "作者说的大城市化是指城市集群/城市圈，比如京津冀、长三角、珠三角、川渝城市群，并不是说单个城市无限扩张。", "reviewId": "917211543_84BglYnAf",